msgstr "![A global initialization with a single per-spin rotation fusing into two preparations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-5.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is left untouched {#what-is-left-untouched}"
msgstr "O que permanece intocado {#what-is-left-untouched}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The pass is deliberately conservative. It only fuses when the two gates genuinely compose into a Slater determinant preparation, and copies everything else through unchanged. “Immediately followed” is understood over the circuit’s data-flow graph. The [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") fuses only when the [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") is its *sole* predecessor across all of its modes. In the figures below, the before and after are identical: nothing fused.\n"
msgstr "O passe é deliberadamente conservador. Ele só funde quando as duas portas realmente compõem uma preparação de determinante de Slater, e copia todo o resto sem alterações. “Imediatamente seguida” é entendido sobre o grafo de fluxo de dados do circuito. A [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") só é fundida quando a [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") é seu *único* predecessor em todos os seus modos. Nas figuras abaixo, o antes e o depois são idênticos: nada foi fundido.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "An operation in between {#an-operation-in-between}"
msgstr "Uma operação no meio {#an-operation-in-between}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If any gate touches the modes between the initialization and the rotation, they no longer compose into a bare preparation, so nothing is merged:\n"
msgstr "Se qualquer porta tocar os modos entre a inicialização e a rotação, elas deixam de compor uma preparação pura, então nada é fundido:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![An operation between the initialization and rotation blocks the merge.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-6.avif)\n"
msgstr "![An operation between the initialization and rotation blocks the merge.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-6.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "A partial rotation that is not a spin half {#a-partial-rotation-that-is-not-a-spin-half}"
msgstr "Uma rotação parcial que não é uma metade de spin {#a-partial-rotation-that-is-not-a-spin-half}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A rotation covering exactly one contiguous spin half of a full-register initialization *does* fuse (see the previous section). But a rotation on any *other* partial mode set (fewer modes than the initialization and not one of its two spin halves, such as a sub-range straddling the sector boundary) is not a per-sector preparation. Merging it would silently drop the initialization’s role on the modes it leaves out, so the pass leaves both gates in place:\n"
msgstr "Uma rotação que cobre exatamente uma metade de spin contígua de uma inicialização de registrador completo *é* fundida (veja a seção anterior). Mas uma rotação sobre qualquer *outro* conjunto parcial de modos (menos modos que a inicialização e que não seja uma de suas duas metades de spin, como um subintervalo que atravessa o limite do setor) não é uma preparação por setor. Fundi-la descartaria silenciosamente o papel da inicialização nos modos que ela deixa de fora, então o passe mantém as duas portas no lugar:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A partial rotation that is not a spin half is left unmerged.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-7.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A partial rotation that is not a spin half is left unmerged.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-7.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why it matters: the synthesis payoff {#why-it-matters-the-synthesis-payoff}"
msgstr "Por que isso importa: o ganho da síntese {#why-it-matters-the-synthesis-payoff}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The merge is worthwhile because [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") synthesizes to far fewer gates than the [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") it absorbs. An $m$-electron determinant over $n$ orbitals needs at most $m(n-m)$ two-qubit rotations and no diagonal phase gates, versus the $n(n-1)/2$ rotations plus $n$ phases of the full square orbital rotation.\n"
msgstr "A fusão compensa porque [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") é sintetizada em muito menos portas que a [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") que ela absorve. Um determinante de $m$ elétrons sobre $n$ orbitais precisa de no máximo $m(n-m)$ rotações de dois qubits e nenhuma porta de fase diagonal, contra as $n(n-1)/2$ rotações mais $n$ fases da rotação orbital quadrada completa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preset Jordan-Wigner pass manager runs [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") in its optimization stage, so this reduction happens automatically. Transpile a two-electron, six-orbital preparation all the way to a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) and count its gates:\n"
msgstr "O pass manager predefinido de Jordan-Wigner executa [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") em sua etapa de otimização, então essa redução acontece automaticamente. Transpile uma preparação de dois elétrons e seis orbitais até chegar a um [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) e conte suas portas:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The preset runs [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\") immediately before [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\"). This matters when a *run* of consecutive [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates follows the initialization. The earlier pass first collapses the run into a single rotation, which [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") then contracts with the initialization into one [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"). Without that ordering, only the first rotation of the run would be absorbed and the rest would synthesize with the full square decomposition.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Nota\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  O preset executa [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\") imediatamente antes de [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\"). Isso importa quando uma *sequência* de portas [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") consecutivas segue a inicialização. O passe anterior primeiro colapsa a sequência em uma única rotação, que [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") então contrai com a inicialização em uma única [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"). Sem essa ordenação, apenas a primeira rotação da sequência seria absorvida e as demais seriam sintetizadas com a decomposição quadrada completa.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The synthesized merged Slater determinant preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-9.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The synthesized merged Slater determinant preparation.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-9.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare that to synthesizing the same orbital rotation on its own. With no preceding initialization there is nothing to merge, so the preset falls back to the full square decomposition, which is deeper and carries diagonal phase gates:\n"
msgstr "Compare isso com a síntese da mesma rotação orbital isoladamente. Sem uma inicialização anterior, não há nada a fundir, então o preset recorre à decomposição quadrada completa, que é mais profunda e traz portas de fase diagonais:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The synthesized bare orbital rotation, with its extra phase gates.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-11.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The synthesized bare orbital rotation, with its extra phase gates.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/merge_slater_determinant-11.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The reduced decomposition drops all six phase gates and nearly halves the two-qubit rotation count. The prepared determinant is correct up to a global phase (physically irrelevant for state preparation), which is what the phase gates would have fixed.\n"
msgstr "A decomposição reduzida elimina as seis portas de fase e reduz quase à metade a quantidade de rotações de dois qubits. O determinante preparado está correto a menos de uma fase global (fisicamente irrelevante para a preparação de estados), que é o que as portas de fase teriam corrigido.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two ways to break the gate down {#two-ways-to-break-the-gate-down}"
msgstr "Duas maneiras de decompor a porta {#two-ways-to-break-the-gate-down}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") can be broken down in two different ways, and they are not interchangeable:\n"
msgstr "Uma [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") pode ser decomposta de duas maneiras diferentes, e elas não são intercambiáveis:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") {#decomposehttpsdocsquantumibmcomapiqiskit-fermionscircuit-fermionic-circuitqiskit-fermionscircuitfermioniccircuitdecompose-qiskit-fermionscircuitfermioniccircuitdecompose}"
msgstr "[`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") {#decomposehttpsdocsquantumibmcomapiqiskit-fermionscircuit-fermionic-circuitqiskit-fermionscircuitfermioniccircuitdecompose-qiskit-fermionscircuitfermioniccircuitdecompose}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expands the gate into its *definition*: the [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") of the reference followed by the full [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"). This is equivalent to the gate as an *operator*, for any input state.\n"
msgstr "Expande a porta em sua *definição*: a [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") da referência seguida da [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") completa. Isso é equivalente à porta como *operador*, para qualquer estado de entrada.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "`PrepareSlaterDeterminant.synthesis`, applied by [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") {#prepareslaterdeterminantsynthesis-applied-by-f2fsynthesishttpsdocsquantumibmcomapiqiskit-fermionstranspiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesisqiskit-fermionstranspilerpassesf2fsynthesis-qiskit-fermionstranspilerpassesf2fsynthesis}"
msgstr "`PrepareSlaterDeterminant.synthesis`, aplicada por [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") {#prepareslaterdeterminantsynthesis-applied-by-f2fsynthesishttpsdocsquantumibmcomapiqiskit-fermionstranspiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesisqiskit-fermionstranspilerpassesf2fsynthesis-qiskit-fermionstranspilerpassesf2fsynthesis}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replaces the gate with the reduced decomposition of this guide. This is equivalent to the gate only as a *state preparation*: it produces the same determinant, up to a global phase, when the modes start in the vacuum. It is cheaper precisely because it assumes that.\n"
msgstr "Substitui a porta pela decomposição reduzida deste guia. Isso é equivalente à porta apenas como *preparação de estado*: ela produz o mesmo determinante, a menos de uma fase global, quando os modos começam no vácuo. Ela é mais barata justamente porque assume isso.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the synthesis when the gate prepares a state on the vacuum, which is what the gate is for and what the transpiler does for you. Use [`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") when the gate has to keep acting as an operator, for example because other gates precede it on the same modes, or when you want to inspect or simulate the plain gates. The [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") pass cannot know which case it is looking at, so it is up to the circuit you give it to prepare the determinant from the vacuum.\n"
msgstr "Use a síntese quando a porta prepara um estado a partir do vácuo, que é para o que a porta serve e o que o transpilador faz por você. Use [`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") quando a porta precisa continuar atuando como operador, por exemplo porque outras portas a precedem nos mesmos modos, ou quando você quer inspecionar ou simular as portas simples. O passe [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") não tem como saber com qual caso está lidando, então cabe ao circuito que você fornece preparar o determinante a partir do vácuo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulating a circuit with ffsim needs neither: every gate applies its whole unitary, so a circuit holding a [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") is simulated as it is, and stays on the fast path for the [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates around it. Breaking only the Slater gate down with `circuit.decompose(\"PrepareSlaterDeterminant\")` leaves those rotations whole, too.\n"
msgstr "Simular um circuito com ffsim não exige nenhuma das duas: cada porta aplica seu unitário completo, então um circuito que contém uma [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") é simulado como está e permanece no caminho rápido para as portas [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") ao redor dela. Decompor apenas a porta de Slater com `circuit.decompose(\"PrepareSlaterDeterminant\")` também deixa essas rotações inteiras.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"See also\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\"), [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"), [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\"), [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\"), [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\"), and the [LUCJ guide](lucj#lucj-transpilation) for the workflow that produces the global-initialization pattern.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Veja também\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\"), [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"), [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\"), [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\"), [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\"), e o [guia de LUCJ](lucj#lucj-transpilation) para o fluxo de trabalho que produz o padrão de inicialização global.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
